# L §4.4's list (tally 2.3, #247; S3 to S5): a reader takes each argument by its own ends, whatever names they
# carry, so `days_between(w, w)` and `age(w, w)` are the hole (days_between is off the list, C3; age's ends differ),
# `overlap_days(w, w, apr)` the value its ends agree on or the hole; `min`, `max` a stretch; `month_of` of a window
# across two months the hole; `weekday` off the list, the hole. Before: 0, 1, 0 by one day taken in turn, a
# stretch of months, a range of weekdays.
=== m.tally
model hd4
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input wide: date
input rate: num
input apr: month
input d2: date
input n5: int
input mrate[m in months]: num
input drate[d in days]: num
def r_at: num = rate at w
def r_wide: num = rate at wide
def r_reader: num = rate at reader
def held: date = w
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w = window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) "c"
  wide = window(2026-04-20, 2026-05-10) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  mrate[*] = 2 "c"
  apr = 2026-04 "c"
  d2 = 2026-04-02 "c"
  n5 = 5 "c"
  drate[*] = 3 "c"
version r1
  cite card
  governs ..2026-04
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 1 "c"
version r2
  cite card
  governs 2026-05..
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 5 "c"
ask a_start: start_of(month_of(w)), start_of(month_of(wide))
ask a_two: days_between(w, w), overlap_days(w, w, apr), age(w, w), min(w, wide), max(w, d2)
ask a_wd: weekday(w)
=== expect
a_start: (2026-04-01, ?"date within window(2026-04-20, 2026-05-10) not precise enough for month_of" (wide))
  unknown day: wide
  cut 2026-04-20
a_two: (?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for days_between" (w), ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for overlap_days" (w), ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for age" (w), window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03), window(2026-04-02, 2026-04-03))
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-04-20
a_wd: ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for weekday" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-04-20
warning: WARN-UNREAD def held is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def r_at is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def r_reader is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def r_wide is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input drate is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input mrate is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n5 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD place konto is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD place world is read by nothing
